      "text": "[6:38PM] #Anthony #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Dorman Long bridge to Fadeyi, Onipanu, Palm Grove, Obanikoro, and Anthony. \nSmooth traffic on Anthony inward Idiroko up to Independence Tunnel, Maryland Odo'iyaaloro to New Garage. \nHowever, slow movement at Ojota down to Ketu/Tsunami Interchange Bridge due to high traffic volume and pedestrians. \nReturn journey from Interchange to Ojota is smooth on both service lane and main carriageway. \nNo impediments reported, with personnel visible on ground managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
